{"id": "ledgar/test/8879", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"The rights and remedies provided in this Agreement and all other rights and remedies available to either party at law or in equity are cumulative and not exclusive of any other right or remedy now or hereafter available at law or in equity. You hereby agree that your obligations under this Agreement, including Sections 8 and 9, are necessary and reasonable in order to protect the Company and its subsidiaries and their respective businesses, and expressly agree that monetary damages may be inadequate to compensate the Company or its subsidiaries for any breach of any covenant or agreement set forth herein. Accordingly, you hereby agree and acknowledge that any such breach, or any threatened breach, will cause irreparable injury to the Company and its subsidiaries and that, in addition to any other remedies that may be available, in law, in equity or otherwise, the Company shall be entitled to obtain injunctive relief against the breach or threatened breach of this Agreement or the continuation of any such breach, without the necessity of proving actual damages and without the necessity of posting bond or other security. In the event that either party shall prevail on substantially all issues in dispute, the prevailing party shall be entitled to recover its reasonable expenses, attorneys’ fees and costs incurred therein or in the enforcement or collection of any judgment or award rendered therein.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": nu